    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Overconfident Know-It-All\r\n\r\nThis AI Chat is prompted to take on the personality of someone who is confident and reasonable-sounding, but it might help to double-check their advice.\r\n\r\n**Do This**: \r\n\r\n1. Attach an screenshot of your Guide from the Backpack\r\n2. Stress test your Responsible AI Guide by interacting with this chatbot designed to challenge your thinking.\r\n3. Refine their advice and suggestions based on the bot's pushback if it feels authentic.",
